WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.067
Gradient descent finds a curve's lowest point.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.333
Start at three, height nine.

3
00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:09.400
Step opposite the slope, downhill, toward zero.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.100
For x squared, the slope is two x; each step subtracts a quarter of it.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.133
From three, slope six takes us to one point five.

6
00:00:21.633 --> 00:00:25.967
Then slope three: point seven five, nearing zero.
